---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { REPO_URL } from "../lib/devices";
---
<Base title="News" description="Omarchy Mobile project news, published on Nostr.">
  <section class="wrap intro">
    <h1>News</h1>
    <p>
      Project updates are published on Nostr as long-form posts, and this page will show them, with an RSS feed made from
      the same posts. Each post links to its Nostr event, so you can reply and zap from any Nostr app.
    </p>
    <p>
      The first posts are on their way. Until then, the
      <a href={`${REPO_URL}/commits/main`}>commit history</a> and the
      <a href={`${REPO_URL}/pulls`}>pull requests</a> show what changed this week.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .intro { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 4.5rem) 2rem; }
  .intro h1 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
</style>
